{"query":"Viral video purportedly shows Pakistani opposition MPs chanted ‘Modi, Modi’ (India's PM)  inside the Pakistani Parliament counterevidence","results":[{"date":"Mar 7, 2022","position":1,"site_name":"newschecker.in","snippet":"Reportedly many Pakistani and Turkish students also stuck in Ukraine used Indian flags to gain safe passage and escape the wartorn country. In this backdrop, a video is going viral on social media claiming that pro Modi slogans were chanted in Pakistan’s parliament after “Pakistan students used India’s flag to escape from Ukraine.”","title":"Misleading Video Claims Pro Modi Slogans Chanted In Pakistan ...","url":"https://newschecker.in/fact-check/pro-modi-slogans-misleading-claim"},{"position":2,"site_name":"newschecker.in","snippet":"Through a relevant keywords search on Google, we came across a Youtube videotitled, “Shah Mehmood Qureshi Speech in National Assembly”. The 17 minute video was posted by Dunya News on 26 October. On slowing down the video and keenly listening we could clearly hear the opposition members in Pakistan’s National Assembly shouting “Voting Voting” not M...","title":"“Modi Modi” Was Not Chanted In Pakistan’s National Assembly ...","url":"https://newschecker.in/fact-check/modi-modi-was-not-chanted-in-pakistans-national-assembly"},{"date":"Oct 29, 2020","position":3,"site_name":"timesofindia.indiatimes.com","snippet":"BJP MP Shobha Karandlaje claimed that the opposition chanted 'Modi-Modi' against the Imran Khan government inside Pakistan parliament.","title":"FACT CHECK: Were ‘Modi-Modi’ chants raised inside Pakistan ...","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/times-fact-check/news/fact-check-were-modi-modi-chants-raised-inside-pakistan-parliament/articleshow/78933241.cms"},{"date":"Oct 29, 2020","position":4,"site_name":"www.indiatoday.in","snippet":"The opposition MPs were chanting “voting, voting” for the passing of a resolution presented by them in the parliament. They did not chant “Modi, Modi”. If several prominent social media handles are to be believed, the Pakistani parliament echoed with pro-Modi slogans during one of its ...","title":"Fact Check: Did Pakistan MPs chant 'Modi, Modi' inside ...","url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/fact-check/story/fact-check-did-pakistan-mps-chant-modi-modi-inside-parliament-1736393-2020-10-29"},{"date":"Jun 25, 2025","position":5,"site_name":"navbharattimes.indiatimes.com","snippet":"Pakistan Parliament Viral Video: Shehbaz Sharif's Reaction To Pm Modi's Praise In The Pakistani Parliament","title":"Pakistan Parliament Viral Video: पाकिस्तानी संसद में पीएम ...","url":"https://navbharattimes.indiatimes.com/video/news/pakistan-parliament-viral-video-shehbaz-sharifs-reaction-to-pm-modis-praise-in-the-pakistani-parliament/videoshow/122053566.cms"},{"date":"Oct 29, 2020","position":6,"site_name":"www.bbc.com","snippet":"The version of the debate presented to make the claim that opposition MPs in Pakistan were chanting Narendra Modi's name has been taken completely out of context.","title":"What's the truth behind claims Pakistani MPs chanted 'Modi'?","url":"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-54732525"},{"date":"Jul 25, 2026","position":7,"site_name":"www.livemint.com","snippet":"Centre fact checks PM Modi's viral deepfake video, accuses ‘Pakistani propaganda accounts’ of misleading AI content The government fact-checked and debunked AI-generated videos of PM Modi and ...","title":"Centre fact checks PM Modi's viral deepfake video, accuses ...","url":"https://www.livemint.com/news/india/centre-fact-checks-pm-modis-viral-deepfake-video-accuses-pakistani-propaganda-accounts-of-misleading-ai-content-11784957145475.html"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}